tients with unresectable or metastatic RAS-mutant non-small cell lung cancer; and with Eli Lilly and Company to evaluate atebimetinib in combination with olomorasib in patients with advanced or metastatic KRAS G12C-mutant non-small cell lung cancer. Immuneering Corporation was incorporated in 2008 and is headquartered in Cambridge, Massachusetts."}}